WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:08.189
Color Rush is a card game where the goal is to get rid of your hand first. If you've ever played Uno, you'll feel right at home.

2
00:00:08.889 --> 00:00:17.880
On your turn, play a card that matches the colour or the number of the top card. Wild cards go on anything, and let you choose the next colour.

3
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:23.486
Can't play? Tap the draw pile, and if the card you pull fits, you can play it straight away.

4
00:00:24.186 --> 00:00:34.997
The special cards are where the trouble starts. Skip makes the next player miss a turn. Reverse flips the direction. Plus two and plus four make someone pick up cards.

5
00:00:35.147 --> 00:00:41.643
And when you're down to your last card, don't forget to call Uno. If someone catches you first, you draw two.

6
00:00:42.343 --> 00:00:49.558
First to empty their hand wins the round. You can play single rounds, or race to a hundred or two hundred points.
